    "現在値だけを metrics-server から取る。呼び出しが軽く、いまの値が最も正確。推移は Prometheus があれば別途出る。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Takes current values from metrics-server only. The calls are light and the value is the most accurate “now”. History still appears separately if Prometheus is present."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現在値だけを metrics-server から取る。呼び出しが軽く、いまの値が最も正確。推移は Prometheus があれば別途出る。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "現在値のみ": {
      "localizations": {
